<Positioned left="90.00" top="356.00" width="900.00" height="120.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="92" color="#D9A441" fontFamily="Noto Serif CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD" letterSpacing="10" decoration="UNDERLINE" decorationColor="#D96C3D" foregroundColor="#D9A441" foregroundMode="STROKE" foregroundStrokeWidth="1.8" softWrap="false" maxLines="1">启幕仪式</Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="90.00" top="520.00" width="900.00" height="150.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="19" color="#D8E2EC" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" height="1.85"><Text>我们诚邀您出席 </Text><Text color="#D9A441" fontStyle="BOLD" fontFamily="Noto Serif CJK SC">秋迁观鸟季</Text><Text>启幕仪式——与 </Text><Text color="#D96C3D" fontStyle="BOLD" fontFamily="Inter">287</Text><Text> 种候鸟一起，送走今年最后一批北方的客人。</Text></Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="90.00" top="640.00" width="900.00" height="150.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="19" color="#D8E2EC" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" height="1.85"><Text>当日有 </Text><WidgetSpan alignment="BOTTOM"><Container width="30" height="30" shape="CIRCLE" color="#D9A441"><Container width="30" height="30" shape="CIRCLE" color="transparent" alignment="CENTER"><Text fontSize="15" color="#12233A" fontFamily="Inter" fontStyle="BOLD">4</Text></Container></Container></WidgetSpan><Text> 场定点观测讲解、夜观装备体验与茶点；凭此函可携 </Text><Text color="#D96C3D" fontStyle="BOLD" fontFamily="Inter">1</Text><Text> 名同行人入场。</Text></Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="90.00" top="790.00" width="900.00" height="90.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="24" color="#F5EFE3" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" height="1.6"><WidgetSpan alignment="BOTTOM"><Container width="72" height="72" shape="CIRCLE" color="#D96C3D"><Container width="72" height="72" shape="CIRCLE" color="transparent" alignment="CENTER"><Text fontSize="30" color="#F5EFE3" fontFamily="Noto Serif CJK SC" fontStyle="BOLD">20</Text></Container></Container></WidgetSpan><Text fontStyle="BOLD" fontFamily="Noto Serif CJK SC">  十一月 · 周五 </Text><Text color="#D9A441" fontStyle="BOLD" fontFamily="Inter">16:00 – 17:30</Text><Text fontFamily="Noto Serif CJK SC">   ·   鹭洲湿地公园 科普馆露台</Text></Text></Container></Positioned>
<Positioned left="90.00" top="880.00" width="900.00" height="30.00"><Container color="transparent"><Text fontSize="15" color="#93A5B8" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC"><WidgetSpan alignment="BOTTOM"><Container width="10" height="10" shape="CIRCLE" color="#D9A441"/></WidgetSpan><Text>  秋迁最佳观测期 11–12 月 · 建议携带望远镜与防风外套  </Text><WidgetSpan alignment="BOTTOM"><Container width="10" height="10" shape="CIRCLE" color="#D9A441"/></WidgetSpan></Text></Container></Positioned>
